raph","text":"そうして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人として良い人生を築きたいなって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広い視野と感受性を豊かに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は文を綴るのも好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のうちに沢山自分の心境や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想いを書き留めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来の自分に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の自分を残したいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くなってしまいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に真面目なブログでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からは元に戻るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-53153":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生配信見てくださった皆様、\nありがとうございました😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神経衰弱、楽しかっです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アバターも検討したんですが、なかなか準備に時間がかかりそうなので今回は断念しました💦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、今回は制服を🫧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学園ドラマが小さい頃から大好きだったので、私も味わいたいと思い制服着てみました🤭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服。\nちなみに小中高全てブレザーでした。\nだから憧れのセーラーです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ49NBH2SPVA5XFZG67D5N3Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はハロウィンですね🎃"},{"type":"break"},